"This feature is not yet implemented." = "此功能尚未实现。";
"Network error: %@" = "网络错误：%@";
"Authorization expired. Please sign in again." = "授权已过期。请重新登录。";
"Two-factor authentication required. Enter your 6-digit code and try again." = "需要双重认证。请输入你的 6 位验证码后重试。";
