"Storage quota exceeded." = "已超出存储配额。";
"Rate limited. Please try again later." = "请求过于频繁。请稍后重试。";
"Server error (HTTP %d)." = "服务器错误（HTTP %d）。";
"Invalid response from server." = "服务器返回了无效响应。";
"Invalid email or password." = "电子邮件或密码无效。";
"File is too large to upload (%@). This provider's limit is %@." = "文件过大，无法上传（%@）。此服务商的上限为 %@。";
"File is too large to upload (%@). The provider rejected it. Try splitting the file or using a different cloud." = "文件过大，无法上传（%@）。服务商已拒绝。请尝试拆分文件或改用其他云服务。";
